### Score synchronously (normal purchase)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "demo-1",
  "customerId": "cust-demo",
  "amount": 42.50,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "merchantId": "m-101",
  "merchantCategory": "GROCERY",
  "deviceId": "iphone-rishi",
  "latitude": 53.3498,
  "longitude": -6.2603,
  "timestamp": "2026-10-15T09:00:00Z"
}

### Same card in New York 10 minutes later, new device, crypto merchant -> DECLINE
