### Submit through Kafka (async)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "demo-3",
  "customerId": "cust-demo-2",
  "amount": 7200,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "merchantId": "m-555",
  "merchantCategory": "GAMBLING",
  "deviceId": "laptop-1",
  "latitude": 53.3498,
  "longitude": -6.2603,
  "timestamp": "2026-10-15T09:00:00Z"
}

### Look up a decision
GET http://localhost:8080/api/decisions/demo-3

### Recent decisions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/decisions?limit=10

### Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
